      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p><strong>Default Peely from: Fortnite Battle Royale</strong></p>\n<p>Drag &amp; Drop in your SPT directory [SPT_Runtime&gt;user&gt;mods]</p>\n<p>Credits: Fortnite, Epic Games + <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/user-file-list/65738-wuvgawore/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WUVGAWORE</a></p>\n<p>After installation it’ll be in Ragman Clothing Services</p>\n<p><strong>Recommended but not required:</strong> Use the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2008/transmog\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Transmog</a> mod to prevent any gear from clipping through</p>\n<p>All credit for the porting goes to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/user-file-list/65738-wuvgawore/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WUVGAWORE</a></p>\n<p>Please note, there will be no further updates.</p>\n",
